  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• MGシリーズ200体達成を記念して、「ガンダムセンチネル」から大型アイテム「PLAN303E ディープ・ストライカー」が登場！",
      "en": "• To commemorate the achievement of 200 MG series, a large item \"PLAN303E Deep Striker \" is now available from \" Gundam Sentinel\"!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• メガ粒子砲は約540mmの圧巻サイズとなっているほか、大型ディスク・レドームやマルチ・センサーなどの細かい造形も精密に再現！",
      "en": "• The mega particle cannon has an impressive size of approximately 540mm, and the detailed shapes such as the large disk radome and multi-sensor are also precisely reproduced!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 機体各所のシリンダー部分にはメッキ加工が施され「重厚感」が付加されている！",
      "en": "• The cylinder parts of various parts of the aircraft are plated to give it a \"heavy feel\"!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• S ガンダム本体も一部新規造形で立体化！",
      "en": "• S Gundam body is also three-dimensional with some new modeling!"
    }
  ],
